<title>USA: BEFORE THE BELL - Micron off slightly.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - Micron off slightly.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Micron Technology Inc fell 1/4 from the Monday close of 33-5/8 in U.S. pre-opening trade after the company reported weaker earnings.</p>
<p>Micron said Monday that it posted first quarter earnings of $0.10 per share compared with $1.51 a year ago. The current quarter included a $0.03 per diluted share gain. It said the current quarter results were hurt by &quot;significantly lower pricing&quot; for memory chips.</p>
<p>Shares of Tylan General Inc rose five from the Monday close of 14-1/4 after Millipore Corp said it would buy Tylan for $16 per share in cash.</p>
